# OPAQUE-ACTUAL-KNOWN-LAYOUT's program: a Structure of a known declaration given through an opaque formal to a
# Structure formal.  The reservation of its pair map happens with the checks now (RECEPTION-EDGE-DEBTS (d)): via's
# p reaches c's box, and a = 5 by the ordinary admission.  Until 2026-10-05 the translator stopped at "internal: a
# pair map of D-105 was asked for after the maps were declared".  Entry 5.
Model:
    int: a 1
    int: v 4
end: Model

fn: c (Model: box) int
    return: box\v + 1
end: c

fn: via (@: void p) int
    return: c(p)
end: via

m: merge: Model
int: a via(m)
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: a; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
